<title>NETHERLANDS: Philips to restructure U.S. Media unit.</title>
<headline>Philips to restructure U.S. Media unit.</headline>
<dateline>EINDHOVEN, Netherlands 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philips Electronics NV said on Friday it was to restructure its U.S. Multimedia group in California, with the loss of around 120 jobs.  </p>
<p>Philips said it had decided to restructure its Multimedia group in Los Angeles because of a revision in market expectations.</p>
<p>&quot;The multimedia software sector is struggling with overproduction, falling prices and therefore a downward pressure on margins,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000 fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
